text = "[center]Tutorial[/center]
The top left shows the clock and how much time you have remaining until you are attacked by the Boss.

Each step you take consumes some amount of time depending on the terrain.

Roads         consume very little time, hills        and forests         consume more, and you cannot cross water        or mountains          without special items!
[center]Press the Interact key (E/Enter) to begin![/center]"
scroll_active = false

